## 8. Quality Bar

A good task prompt must make these clear:

1. What to do.
2. What not to do.
3. Which files can be changed.
4. Which files must not be changed.
5. Which platform risks are forbidden.
6. Which validations must run.
7. When to stop.
8. What to report.
9. Whether next stage is allowed.
10. Mandatory completion summary format.

Do not output vague tasks like "optimize the project" or "improve code quality" without boundaries.
